    "连接 Apple 健康后，可以在这里查看数据来源的连接状态。仅在你授权后读取选定数据，不会向 Apple 健康写入，也不会上传健康数据。你可以在“健康”App 的个人资料中管理权限。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Connect Apple Health to check your data sources. Selected data is read only with your permission. Health data is never uploaded or written. Manage permissions in your profile in the Health app."
